    {
      "id": "s2-intro",
      "type": "intro",
      "label": null,
      "title": "IU — Good day",
      "content": "Inability. \"I can't stop thinking about you.\"\n\nGood Day is about the exact moment you decide to confess to someone, and everything that spirals through your head right before you say it. IU walks through her own nervous stalling — is the sky too perfectly blue on purpose, should she pretend not to notice something's wrong, is her new haircut the problem — before finally blurting out, in tears, that she likes him.\n\nIn this lesson, you'll learn the grammar pattern **-지 못하다**, which means \"cannot do.\" We'll see how IU uses it in \"Good day.\"",
      "musicPlaying": true
    },
    {
      "id": "s3-intro",
      "type": "intro",
      "label": null,
      "title": "이번에 배울 것",
      "content": "이번 레슨에서 배울 단어:\n- **멈추다** — to stop\n- **잊다** — to forget\n- **멈추지 못하다** — to be unable to stop\n- **잊지 못하다** — to be unable to forget\n\n레슨이 끝나면, 이 노래의 가사를 이해할 수 있어요.",
      "musicPlaying": true
    },
